{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>江旻憓冀本港體育普及化專業化　讓運動員不用向現實低頭放棄</strong></p><p>・江旻憓關注體育普及化<br>・倡運動員專業化發展<br>・希望運動員无需向現實低頭<br>・避免因現實放棄運動<br>・提升本港體育發展</p><p>暫時未能從Now 新聞擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://news.now.com/home/local/player?newsId=666653\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:53.102920+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"minimal","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:27:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.247294+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.247294+00:00","content_hash":"c8637c29be69818fb25efa5283c3a26f889b09604b156de28729d776f8f2fc52","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}